honest with you here, Mike.


00:09:42.242 --> 00:09:45.084
Given your track record, your options...


00:09:45.119 --> 00:09:47.551
are gonna be extremely limited.


00:09:47.586 --> 00:09:50.340
I'll take anything, okay?
Any-any job you got. - No. No.


00:09:50.375 --> 00:09:54.802
Look, I-I-I get that
part. Um, it's just...


00:09:55.595 --> 00:09:58.013
You know, it's not that easy.


00:10:00.307 --> 00:10:02.524
Yeah. Thank you.


00:10:02.559 --> 00:10:04.937
I have a job for you.


00:10:06.981 --> 00:10:08.190
Come on, sit down.


00:10:09.567 --> 00:10:11.735
Sit, sit, sit, sit, sit.


00:10:12.945 --> 00:10:15.948
Okay, uh, well, what is it?


00:10:15.983 --> 00:10:18.917
It's a security gig.


00:10:18.952 --> 00:10:21.787
Full disclosure: It's not great.


00:10:21.822 --> 00:10:23.087
Right? High turnover.


00:10:23.122 --> 00:10:25.124
That's what we call it in the business,


00:10:25.159 --> 00:10:27.331
but you get to be
your own boss. Sort of.


00:10:27.366 --> 00:10:29.504
And you only have to
worry about one thing.


00:10:29.539 --> 00:10:31.845
Keeping people out.


00:10:31.880 --> 00:10:33.633
And-and, you know, and
keep the place tidy.


00:10:33.668 --> 00:10:34.968
That's two things.


00:10:36.636 --> 00:10:38.812
You want the job or not?


00:10:38.847 --> 00:10:40.890
- How's the pay?
- Not great.


00:10:40.925 --> 00:10:44.184
But the hours are worse.


00:10:45.770 --> 00:10:47.647
I can't do nights.


00:10:47.682 --> 00:10:49.732
Excuse me?


00:10:50.525 --> 00:10:52.317
I can't do nights.


00:10:55.904 --> 00:10:57.614
That's such a shame.


00:10:57.649 --> 00:10:59.701
Yeah.


00:11:00.744 --> 00:11:02.578
Thank you.


00:11:02.613 --> 00:11:04.413
Wait, uh...


00:11:05.623 --> 00:11:08.083
