00:28:33.497 --> 00:28:35.632
I thought it was breakfast.


00:28:35.667 --> 00:28:37.182
Some people say that,


00:28:37.217 --> 00:28:39.051
but, you know, it's just a theory.
- Are you being paid


00:28:39.086 --> 00:28:41.053
